          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">✓ Right to Erasure ("Right to be Forgotten")</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Request deletion of your personal data, subject to certain exceptions (e.g., legal obligations to retain data).</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">✓ Right to Restrict Processing</h4>
