            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Request a copy of your personal data in a structured, commonly used, machine-readable format that you can transfer to another service.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">✓ Right to Object</h4>
